      },
      "message": "fix(post,app): read post scripts and machine files from disk at run time\n\nThe desktop executable no longer compiles in the 16 shipped post scripts\nand the machine library. camcraft_post::data_dir finds assets/<kind>\nbeside the executable (macOS bundle, per-user data dir, dev and source\ntree as later candidates) and each file is read once into a static cell.\nA missing directory or file is an error that names both; the wasm32\nbuild keeps its compiled-in copy. Each read logs the file path once.\n\nFixes #2282\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
